      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 Telegram supplier feed\nReceives posts from supplier channels where the bot is an **admin** (or groups where privacy mode allows it). SAFQA ignores chats not registered on a supplier record, parses price/MOQ, deduplicates by message id and suggests (never confirms) a product match. Telegram allows ONE webhook per bot: do not also set TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET direct webhook.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "daabfdfa-a98a-ae77-406b-94448b1ebc74",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
